{"sectionId":"genetics/population","items":[{"id":"genetics--population-k001","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"대립유전자 빈도 p+q=1인 이대립유전자 좌위에서 무작위 교배와 적절한 평형 조건을 가정하면 유전자형 빈도는 p²,2pq,q²이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k002","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"우성 표현형 빈도에서 열성 표현형 q²를 빼거나 직접 구해 q를 계산할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k003","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"대립유전자 빈도는 동형접합자 빈도와 이형접합자 빈도의 절반을 합하여 구한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k004","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"자연선택은 적응도 차이로 빈도를 변화시키며 유전적 부동은 작은 집단에서 특히 크다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k005","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"돌연변이, 유전자 흐름, 비무작위 교배, 선택과 부동은 평형 가정을 교란할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k006","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"근친교배는 대립유전자 빈도 변화 없이도 동형접합 비율을 높일 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k007","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"병목효과와 창시자효과는 부동의 사례다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k008","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"계통수는 공통 조상과 분기 관계를 나타내며 현재 종 사이의 진화적 서열을 뜻하지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k009","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"열성 표현형 빈도 q²에서 q=√q².","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k010","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"적응도는 생존뿐 아니라 번식 기여를 포함한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k011","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"개체가 진화하는 것이 아니라 집단의 유전적 구성이 세대에 따라 변화한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--population-k012","sectionId":"genetics/population","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"2×0.99×0.01=0.0198, 약 1.98%이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-and-historical-overlap","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}